OL,3,GNEWSAHealth board declares critical
OL,4,Aincident over 'extreme' A&E pressure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Scottish health board has declared a
OL,7,Fcritical incident over "extreme
OL,8,Fpressure" on A&E services.
OL,10,FNHS Grampian said emergency departments
OL,11,Fat Aberdeen Royal Infirmary and Dr
OL,12,FGray's Hospital in Elgin are struggling
OL,13,Fto cope with demand.
OL,15,FThe board's Shantini Paranjothy said
OL,16,Fcare services were also stretched and
OL,17,Fpatient capacity had been reached prior
OL,18,Fto a local bank holiday on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
