OL,3,GNEWSAHealth board declares critical
OL,4,Aincident over 'extreme' A&E pressure
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said some ambulances would be
OL,7,Fdiverted to other regions including NHS
OL,8,FTayside and NHS Highland and patients
OL,9,Fmay face "longer waits" to receive
OL,10,Fcare.
